;; Sophia III's training stage (0.4.38, src/game/tutorial/heroes/sophia.ts; docs/HEROES.md), in
;; the Blaster Master Underworld forest look: a held jump onto the plateau, the cannon through the
;; brick wall and up at the target above (gate 21), the nose-first dip through the bridge's narrow
;; hole to the passage, Jason out for the coins down the pit only he fits and back in (gate 50), the
;; Power Capsule and the hover over the wide ditch, the Crusher's one shot at the tough target (gate
;; 85), the Triple Missile through the box's wall (gate 100), Wall Climb up the tall wall, Ceiling
;; Climb along the roof over the second ditch (gate 137), the Homing Missile at the target up on the
;; ledge (gate 151) and the flagpole. Each power block's item is in [hero-items]; the gates are laid
;; by the tutorial.
